1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"></font>

2
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"></font>

3
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kaki narase sonzai wo</b></font></font></font>

4
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>rock away your existence</b></font></font></font>

5
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>koko ni iru to</b></font></font></font>

6
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>shouting that you are here</b></font></font></font>

7
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:11,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>arata na tabi ga ima hajimaru</b></font></font></font>

8
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:11,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>a new journey begins now</b></font></font></font>

9
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:28,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kawari yuku kisetsu no naka wo ikinuku tabi ni bokura</b></font></font></font>

10
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:28,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>as we survived through the changing seasons</b></font></font></font>

11
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>chie to tsuyosa wo te ni ireta kedo JUST LOOKS LIKE SURVIVAL GAME</b></font></font></font>

12
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>we gained knowledge and strength (just looks like a survival game)</b></font></font></font>

13
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>nagareteku jikan no naka ni</b></font></font></font>

14
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>but the forgotten memories</b></font></font></font>

15
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>okizari ni shita omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

16
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>of the feelings abandoned within the flows of time</b></font></font></font>

17
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>wasureta koto sura wasurete ita</b></font></font></font>

18
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>have also been lost</b></font></font></font>

19
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kuzure kaketa toki kodoku wo shitte</b></font></font></font>

20
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>when sinking down we learned loneliness</b></font></font></font>

21
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>deaeta bokura hitori ja nai</b></font></font></font>

22
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>but now we've met each other we are no longer alone</b></font></font></font>

23
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>sarake dase kanjou wo banjou no omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

24
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>unveil your feelings those high emotions</b></font></font></font>

25
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>namidame ga unmei wo kaete yuku</b></font></font></font>

26
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>those tears will change your fate</b></font></font></font>

27
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>yami ni uchi narase kodou wo</b></font></font></font>

28
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>pound your heartbeat against the darkness</b></font></font></font>

29
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kitto aeru yo onaji itami no hata no moto de</b></font></font></font>

30
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>we're sure to meet under the same flag of pain</b></font></font></font>

31
00:01:39,240 --> 00:01:42,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks like
the preparations are complete.</font>

32
00:01:44,040 --> 00:01:47,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So this is the Land of Greens
you were talking about, brother?</font>

33
00:01:48,750 --> 00:01:50,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, it's a small land,</font>

34
00:01:50,710 --> 00:01:52,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but it could be a good stepping-stone
for getting ahead in the world.</font>

35
00:01:53,420 --> 00:01:56,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We've already bought off
half of the public officials.</font>

36
00:01:56,720 --> 00:01:59,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This land will be overturned
on our signal.</font>

37
00:02:00,760 --> 00:02:04,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As of today,
we're the feudal lords of this land.</font>

38
00:02:04,600 --> 00:02:05,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Feudal lords, huh...?</font>

39
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:08,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That has a nice ring to it.</font>

40
00:02:11,310 --> 00:02:15,820
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Starting a Business!!</font>

41
00:02:11,310 --> 00:02:15,820
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Leaf Village Moving Center</font>

42
00:02:16,360 --> 00:02:17,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a problem...</font>

43
00:02:17,570 --> 00:02:20,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought about testing out
various combinations, but it backfired.</font>

44
00:02:21,200 --> 00:02:24,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With these remaining members,
there's nobody who can take the lead.</font>

45
00:02:24,830 --> 00:02:27,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it's merchant protection this time,</font>

46
00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:31,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so no matter who goes,
there probably isn't much to worry about.</font>

47
00:02:31,380 --> 00:02:33,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mission difficulty isn't the issue.</font>

48
00:02:34,250 --> 00:02:35,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a commission from
the Land of Greens.</font>

49
00:02:35,920 --> 00:02:38,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wanted to send them
a respectable team.</font>

50
00:02:38,970 --> 00:02:42,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The lord of the castle there
was good to me in the old days!</font>

51
00:02:43,180 --> 00:02:44,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">True indeed...</font>

52
00:02:44,850 --> 00:02:49,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He generously assumed the debts
for the bundle you blew on gambling.</font>

53
00:02:49,980 --> 00:02:53,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's small,
but it's a nice and easygoing land.</font>

54
00:02:53,940 --> 00:02:59,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There was an adorable princess,
and two boy ninja looked after her...</font>

55
00:03:00,070 --> 00:03:04,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At that time,
they both said they'd marry me...</font>

56
00:03:04,910 --> 00:03:06,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if they still feel that way...</font>

57
00:03:06,910 --> 00:03:08,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't think so.</font>

58
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:11,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I bet they've all gotten big...</font>

59
00:03:21,050 --> 00:03:22,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll be at the border soon.</font>

60
00:03:22,930 --> 00:03:25,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is our last look at this scenery
for a while.</font>

61
00:03:30,640 --> 00:03:33,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! A mission, a mission!</font>

62
00:03:35,440 --> 00:03:36,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait up, Naruto!</font>

63
00:03:37,440 --> 00:03:39,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone else was off on missions,</font>

64
00:03:39,280 --> 00:03:42,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but I've been doing nothing but
odd jobs in the village!</font>

65
00:03:43,110 --> 00:03:46,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was sick of hearing stories
about everyone's adventures.</font>

66
00:03:46,780 --> 00:03:49,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Still,
we're guarding merchants this time.</font>

67
00:03:49,790 --> 00:03:51,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's probably not something
to brag about.</font>

68
00:03:52,250 --> 00:03:55,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I should exaggerate
the story a bit</font>

69
00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:58,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and say that I took out
about a thousand bandits, right?</font>

70
00:03:59,090 --> 00:04:00,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's just lying.</font>

71
00:04:05,680 --> 00:04:08,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! There they are. That's them!</font>

72
00:04:15,150 --> 00:04:15,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who are you?</font>

73
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:19,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys are merchants
from the Land of Greens, right?</font>

74
00:04:20,570 --> 00:04:21,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right.</font>

75
00:04:21,740 --> 00:04:24,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We've come from
the Village Hidden in Leaves</font>

76
00:04:24,070 --> 00:04:25,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to protect you guys.</font>

77
00:04:25,950 --> 00:04:27,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Village Hidden in Leaves?</font>

78
00:04:27,740 --> 00:04:29,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See...? This, this.</font>

79
00:04:29,870 --> 00:04:33,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We were told to protect you
from mountain bandits...</font>

80
00:04:36,460 --> 00:04:37,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's for certain.</font>

81
00:04:39,340 --> 00:04:40,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm Uzumaki Naruto.</font>

82
00:04:41,380 --> 00:04:42,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And this is Hinata.</font>

83
00:04:43,170 --> 00:04:44,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm Akimichi Choji.</font>

84
00:04:44,970 --> 00:04:49,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We received one more item
from the Hokage</font>

85
00:04:49,560 --> 00:04:51,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to identify ourselves with.</font>

86
00:04:55,980 --> 00:04:57,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Momiji.</font>

87
00:04:57,520 --> 00:04:58,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give it back.</font>

88
00:04:59,020 --> 00:05:00,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, it's true.</font>

89
00:05:00,730 --> 00:05:03,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These people are from
the Village of the Hidden Leaf.</font>

90
00:05:04,450 --> 00:05:05,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See...?</font>

91
00:05:04,820 --> 00:05:07,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}{THE LEAF MOVING SERVICE</b></font>

92
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:09,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's that?</font>

93
00:05:10,450 --> 00:05:13,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Old lady Tsunade...
she's done it this time!</font>

94
00:05:15,830 --> 00:05:16,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

95
00:05:16,870 --> 00:05:17,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm Kikusuke.</font>

96
00:05:18,670 --> 00:05:19,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is Yurinoshin.</font>

97
00:05:20,380 --> 00:05:21,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's Shun.</font>

98
00:05:22,090 --> 00:05:25,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm Momiji!
We'll be counting on you movers!</font>

99
00:05:39,270 --> 00:05:40,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You sure eat a lot.</font>

100
00:05:40,940 --> 00:05:42,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why you're so f...</font>

101
00:05:42,730 --> 00:05:44,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Fa...?!
— full figured.</font>

102
00:05:45,780 --> 00:05:46,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For you.</font>

103
00:05:47,070 --> 00:05:49,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I love people with great strength.</font>

104
00:05:49,620 --> 00:05:51,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Something like this is a cinch.</font>

105
00:05:51,870 --> 00:05:53,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See? Watch.</font>

106
00:05:53,330 --> 00:05:55,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Roll, roll, roll...</font>

107
00:05:55,080 --> 00:05:56,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Somebody help me!</font>

108
00:05:59,210 --> 00:06:02,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Choji, getting all carried away.</font>

109
00:06:02,500 --> 00:06:04,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Move faster, mover.</font>

110
00:06:05,010 --> 00:06:06,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're rapidly falling behind.</font>

111
00:06:06,670 --> 00:06:09,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're not movers, I'm telling you.</font>

112
00:06:09,840 --> 00:06:12,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't you help out
before complaining?!</font>

113
00:06:12,810 --> 00:06:13,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, it's fine.</font>

114
00:06:15,850 --> 00:06:18,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Our cousin Shun is in poor health.</font>

115
00:06:20,560 --> 00:06:23,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't need to worry,
Kikusuke, Yurinoshin.</font>

116
00:06:24,440 --> 00:06:25,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I had no intention of
listening to anything</font>

117
00:06:25,900 --> 00:06:27,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">this good-for-nothing has had to say
from the start.</font>

118
00:06:27,900 --> 00:06:31,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who's a good-for-nothing?!
Just you watch!</font>

119
00:06:38,250 --> 00:06:40,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Honestly,
it's because you push yourself too far...</font>

120
00:06:40,500 --> 00:06:43,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry...
Shun's being unreasonable.</font>

121
00:06:44,130 --> 00:06:45,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Water! Oh.</font>

122
00:06:49,800 --> 00:06:51,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mine's empty, too.</font>

123
00:06:52,010 --> 00:06:53,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then there's some fresh drawn water.</font>

124
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:55,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here!</font>

125
00:06:56,060 --> 00:06:59,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wow,
how'd you find water in a place like this?</font>

126
00:07:00,270 --> 00:07:02,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My grandma taught me.</font>

127
00:07:02,770 --> 00:07:03,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your grandma?</font>

128
00:07:04,150 --> 00:07:05,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's this...</font>

129
00:07:05,650 --> 00:07:07,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can tell with this.</font>

130
00:07:07,820 --> 00:07:09,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! With those?</font>

131
00:07:10,030 --> 00:07:11,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's called dousing.</font>

132
00:07:11,780 --> 00:07:13,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you concentrate
on the item you're looking for...</font>

133
00:07:13,950 --> 00:07:17,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">these rods will react to that item
and will inform you when you're near it.</font>

134
00:07:18,580 --> 00:07:21,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's knowledge passed on
from our predecessors.</font>

135
00:07:22,630 --> 00:07:24,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When I get back to the village,</font>

136
00:07:24,250 --> 00:07:26,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">maybe I'll try to find money
that people dropped with that.</font>

137
00:07:29,630 --> 00:07:30,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tasty!</font>

138
00:07:41,310 --> 00:07:44,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It doesn't compare to the water in the
Land of Greens, but it's good water.</font>

139
00:07:45,060 --> 00:07:47,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come to think of it,
what kind of place is the Land of Greens?</font>

140
00:07:48,400 --> 00:07:52,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Land of Greens is...
a small land deep in the mountains.</font>

141
00:07:52,990 --> 00:07:56,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone in the land loves nature
and is warm-hearted.</font>

142
00:07:57,740 --> 00:07:59,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was indeed Shangri-La...</font>

143
00:08:00,250 --> 00:08:01,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Was...?</font>

144
00:08:01,540 --> 00:08:02,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, it's nothing...</font>

145
00:08:02,290 --> 00:08:06,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, you know, if it's such a great place,
why do you need protection?</font>

146
00:08:10,300 --> 00:08:12,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's targeted because
the people take peace for granted!</font>

147
00:08:17,220 --> 00:08:18,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean by that?</font>

148
00:08:19,350 --> 00:08:23,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stuff like loving nature
and being warm-hearted sounds nice.</font>

149
00:08:23,690 --> 00:08:27,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But the bottom line is that the people
in the Land of Greens are all softhearted.</font>

150
00:08:27,770 --> 00:08:29,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We live in a troubled time now.</font>

151
00:08:29,440 --> 00:08:31,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Something like believing in people
is ridiculous.</font>

152
00:08:32,400 --> 00:08:36,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, the Land of Greens is not
something to speak ill of like that.</font>

153
00:08:37,030 --> 00:08:43,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The lord of the castle there was kind
even to us merchants passing through.</font>

154
00:08:47,710 --> 00:08:50,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think he'd take up that kind
of attitude with an old lady...</font>

155
00:08:50,340 --> 00:08:52,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's kind of disagreeable.</font>

156
00:08:53,050 --> 00:08:55,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's your cousin, right?
Do something about him.</font>

157
00:08:56,340 --> 00:08:57,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right.</font>

158
00:08:57,890 --> 00:09:00,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's probably a bit touchy
from the bad things that have happened.</font>

159
00:09:01,140 --> 00:09:01,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry...</font>

160
00:09:02,310 --> 00:09:04,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, it's okay...</font>

161
00:09:09,190 --> 00:09:11,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, that's dangerous.</font>

162
00:09:13,190 --> 00:09:15,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's dangerous
to wander around alone.</font>

163
00:09:16,450 --> 00:09:18,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Brother Choji, look at that...</font>

164
00:09:22,660 --> 00:09:23,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

165
00:09:23,870 --> 00:09:24,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

166
00:09:25,080 --> 00:09:25,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That.</font>

167
00:09:25,870 --> 00:09:26,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is that?</font>

168
00:09:27,420 --> 00:09:29,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's in the direction of
the Land of Greens, right?!</font>

169
00:09:30,040 --> 00:09:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to go check it out...
You take the others and go on ahead.</font>

170
00:09:34,050 --> 00:09:35,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll be right back.</font>

171
00:09:40,100 --> 00:09:40,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen.</font>

172
00:09:41,220 --> 00:09:42,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What we saw here is a secret.</font>

173
00:09:43,020 --> 00:09:45,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We don't want everyone to get worried.</font>

174
00:09:45,310 --> 00:09:46,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah. Got it.</font>

175
00:09:51,190 --> 00:09:52,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where's Naruto?</font>

176
00:09:53,780 --> 00:09:55,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The bathroom...</font>

177
00:10:20,590 --> 00:10:23,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll give this to you
if you tell me what you saw earlier.</font>

178
00:10:26,680 --> 00:10:29,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Black smoke... was rising.</font>

179
00:10:29,980 --> 00:10:32,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Black smoke...?! From where?</font>

180
00:10:33,730 --> 00:10:35,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The direction of the Land of Greens.</font>

181
00:10:36,860 --> 00:10:37,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lord Shun...</font>

182
00:10:38,240 --> 00:10:38,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's finally...</font>

183
00:10:45,040 --> 00:10:47,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I should be at the Land of Greens
border pretty soon.</font>

184
00:10:55,340 --> 00:10:59,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What was that...?
There was no presence at all.</font>

185
00:11:07,560 --> 00:11:09,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who are you guys!</font>

186
00:11:17,320 --> 00:11:19,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who are you guys?</font>

187
00:11:19,990 --> 00:11:23,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That headband. You're with
the Hidden Leaf Village, right?</font>

188
00:11:23,570 --> 00:11:27,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So what if I am?
Why are you targeting me?</font>

189
00:11:27,950 --> 00:11:31,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have no intention
of fighting you guys.</font>

190
00:11:31,750 --> 00:11:36,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems the ones we are looking for
are heading this direction, you see.</font>

191
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:40,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those who prowl around here will die.</font>

192
00:11:47,600 --> 00:11:48,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did we do it...?</font>

193
00:11:51,140 --> 00:11:52,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Substitution Jutsu?!</font>

194
00:11:52,440 --> 00:11:54,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The real one is over here!</font>

195
00:12:16,500 --> 00:12:18,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These guys are pretty good.</font>

196
00:12:20,970 --> 00:12:22,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Two left.</font>

197
00:12:22,880 --> 00:12:24,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One of them is the real one!</font>

198
00:12:32,810 --> 00:12:33,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

199
00:12:38,690 --> 00:12:42,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Too bad!
Those two are also clones.</font>

200
00:12:42,490 --> 00:12:45,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to turn back for now...</font>

201
00:12:52,500 --> 00:12:53,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji! Hinata!</font>

202
00:12:55,750 --> 00:12:56,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How'd it go, Naruto?</font>

203
00:12:57,250 --> 00:12:58,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Actually, there's trouble...</font>

204
00:12:59,090 --> 00:13:02,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guys! Let's take a break here
for the time being!</font>

205
00:13:10,510 --> 00:13:12,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pursuers from the Land of Greens?</font>

206
00:13:12,390 --> 00:13:13,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They said that...</font>

207
00:13:13,680 --> 00:13:15,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The ones they were looking for
were headed in this direction.</font>

208
00:13:15,980 --> 00:13:18,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But why would ninja
be after this group?</font>

209
00:13:19,480 --> 00:13:22,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These people are just merchants,
aren't they?</font>

210
00:13:23,150 --> 00:13:25,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And they're not even people
from the Land of Greens to begin with...</font>

211
00:13:26,660 --> 00:13:29,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now that you mention it,
that's right.</font>

212
00:13:29,450 --> 00:13:30,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But what will we do?</font>

213
00:13:30,660 --> 00:13:33,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're going to engage them if they come,
of course.</font>

214
00:13:34,410 --> 00:13:35,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That might be impossible...</font>

215
00:13:35,960 --> 00:13:38,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have elderly people
and children with us.</font>

216
00:13:38,580 --> 00:13:39,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're right...</font>

217
00:13:40,290 --> 00:13:41,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know.</font>

218
00:13:41,550 --> 00:13:45,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It could be that
they're not chasing after us!</font>

219
00:13:45,670 --> 00:13:47,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean by that?</font>

220
00:13:47,890 --> 00:13:52,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Basically, we're moving
in the same direction as their true target</font>

221
00:13:53,060 --> 00:13:55,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and we could just be
in their battle ground... or something.</font>

222
00:13:56,600 --> 00:13:57,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

223
00:13:57,900 --> 00:14:03,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That means if we clear the path,
they'll let us go right by.</font>

224
00:14:03,860 --> 00:14:04,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right.</font>

225
00:14:04,570 --> 00:14:06,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen up, guys!</font>

226
00:14:06,610 --> 00:14:10,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Some kind of troublesome guys
are heading this way.</font>

227
00:14:10,370 --> 00:14:11,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Troublesome guys?</font>

228
00:14:11,740 --> 00:14:15,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, I think everyone will feel anxious
if you say it like that.</font>

229
00:14:15,870 --> 00:14:17,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

230
00:14:17,960 --> 00:14:19,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you don't need to worry.</font>

231
00:14:20,290 --> 00:14:24,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're probably not after us...</font>

232
00:14:24,630 --> 00:14:27,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'll kind of be the long way around,</font>

233
00:14:27,380 --> 00:14:30,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but we'll make it through
if we take a little side turn up ahead.</font>

234
00:14:37,680 --> 00:14:41,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Does this feudal lord
really have this little?</font>

235
00:14:41,480 --> 00:14:43,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's a feudal lord
who's a prestigious ruler of virtue.</font>

236
00:14:43,980 --> 00:14:45,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So he would never line his pockets.</font>

237
00:14:46,150 --> 00:14:47,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But we'll squeeze out a big pile
from now on.</font>

238
00:14:48,780 --> 00:14:51,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More importantly, has the young girl
in question been found?</font>

239
00:14:52,160 --> 00:14:52,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nope...</font>

240
00:14:53,200 --> 00:14:55,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But the two who were tracking her
got attacked.</font>

241
00:14:56,620 --> 00:14:58,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We know the direction she fled in.</font>

242
00:14:59,250 --> 00:15:01,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That young girl just would not be good.</font>

243
00:15:01,540 --> 00:15:06,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If they get away, they may return
with forces from other lands.</font>

244
00:15:07,840 --> 00:15:09,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If the sun were a little stronger,</font>

245
00:15:09,800 --> 00:15:13,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I could burn down a whole mountain
with my jutsu...</font>

246
00:15:17,560 --> 00:15:18,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I'll go...</font>

247
00:15:25,900 --> 00:15:31,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lord Renga, I gathered all collaborators
in the hall as you ordered...</font>

248
00:15:31,740 --> 00:15:33,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, good work.</font>

249
00:15:33,910 --> 00:15:39,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Without your guys' help, we couldn't have
brought down the castle this easily...</font>

250
00:15:41,580 --> 00:15:45,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then brother,
shall we go for the hall greeting?</font>

251
00:15:45,840 --> 00:15:48,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay... I'll take care of things here.</font>

252
00:15:54,220 --> 00:15:57,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, about the thing you promised...</font>

253
00:15:57,890 --> 00:15:59,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, that's right.</font>

254
00:15:59,890 --> 00:16:02,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take as much there as you like.</font>

255
00:16:02,690 --> 00:16:04,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really?</font>

256
00:16:09,690 --> 00:16:13,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Honestly. It's so easy to deceive
softhearted people...</font>

257
00:16:13,780 --> 00:16:16,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It really is exactly so.</font>

258
00:16:16,160 --> 00:16:19,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Our lord believed in us
until the very end...</font>

259
00:16:19,950 --> 00:16:20,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on.</font>

260
00:16:20,950 --> 00:16:25,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you stuff that much in there,
the ferry on death's river will sink.</font>

261
00:16:28,250 --> 00:16:32,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I make it a habit
not to believe in people.</font>

262
00:16:32,380 --> 00:16:36,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Especially people
who have betrayed someone once...</font>

263
00:16:36,050 --> 00:16:38,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're joking, Lord Renga...</font>

264
00:16:38,510 --> 00:16:40,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's no joke.</font>

265
00:16:44,690 --> 00:16:48,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be that you had me
gather the collaborators in the coup d'etat to...</font>

266
00:16:55,820 --> 00:16:58,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're also softhearted!</font>

267
00:17:08,750 --> 00:17:09,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That should do it.</font>

268
00:17:21,680 --> 00:17:25,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yurinojou, it seems they're after us.</font>

269
00:17:25,810 --> 00:17:26,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

270
00:17:26,810 --> 00:17:27,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I leave Lady Haruna to you.</font>

271
00:17:28,400 --> 00:17:29,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you going to do?</font>

272
00:17:30,020 --> 00:17:33,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we wait here for their attack,
there will be too many to defend.</font>

273
00:17:34,440 --> 00:17:37,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since it's come to this,
I'll slow them down.</font>

274
00:17:37,780 --> 00:17:39,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But according to the information,</font>

275
00:17:39,780 --> 00:17:42,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">they are three Janin
who use unknown jutsu.</font>

276
00:17:42,870 --> 00:17:43,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know.</font>

277
00:17:44,120 --> 00:17:47,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But my jutsu will not be defeated
by the likes of them.</font>

278
00:17:48,080 --> 00:17:48,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Very well.</font>

279
00:17:49,170 --> 00:17:50,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go, Kikunojou.</font>

280
00:17:51,380 --> 00:17:52,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, Lady Haruna.</font>

281
00:17:59,720 --> 00:18:00,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto.</font>

282
00:18:00,760 --> 00:18:03,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I set a trap for the time being.</font>

283
00:18:03,310 --> 00:18:05,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez, Hinata.
You're such a worrywart.</font>

284
00:18:05,730 --> 00:18:07,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't need to go that far.</font>

285
00:18:07,060 --> 00:18:10,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yurinoshin, where's Kikusuke?</font>

286
00:18:10,480 --> 00:18:12,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're right. Since when...?</font>

287
00:18:12,980 --> 00:18:16,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, he had some other business
and went on ahead...</font>

288
00:18:16,280 --> 00:18:20,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say what? Taking liberties like that
is really a problem...</font>

289
00:18:21,530 --> 00:18:23,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, I see.</font>

290
00:18:23,540 --> 00:18:24,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that's it, huh?</font>

291
00:18:26,500 --> 00:18:27,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

292
00:18:27,660 --> 00:18:30,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even Kikusuke makes sure
to go to the bathroom.</font>

293
00:18:31,080 --> 00:18:31,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...!</font>

294
00:18:35,130 --> 00:18:37,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lady Haruna, I shall protect you
with my life!</font>

295
00:18:41,050 --> 00:18:42,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There!</font>

296
00:18:48,690 --> 00:18:49,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who are you...?!</font>

297
00:18:51,520 --> 00:18:52,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm Ruiga.</font>

298
00:18:52,940 --> 00:18:55,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think you'd
just come right on out nonchalantly.</font>

299
00:18:56,070 --> 00:18:58,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then she must in that group, right?</font>

300
00:18:59,110 --> 00:19:02,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it's one against one,
I won't lose to a hired ninja like you!</font>

301
00:19:04,120 --> 00:19:05,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can you do it?</font>

302
00:19:05,620 --> 00:19:08,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Have a taste of
the Land of Greens' Flower Ninja Art!</font>

303
00:19:19,720 --> 00:19:22,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eat this! Flower Shuriken!
Flying Flowers: Falling Foliage!</font>

304
00:19:31,600 --> 00:19:32,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Too easy...</font>

305
00:19:33,610 --> 00:19:34,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know about that!</font>

306
00:19:40,070 --> 00:19:42,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Flower Ninja Art: Release!
Myriad of Flowers!</font>

307
00:19:45,370 --> 00:19:47,330
